flowchart TD
    A[Approved Plan] --> B[Add Realization]
    B --> C[Transaction Data]
    C --> D[Attachment]
    D --> E[Review Amount vs Remaining]
    E --> F{Valid?}
    F -->|No| G[Show Error]
    G --> C
    F -->|Yes| H[Save Draft / Submit]
    H --> I[SUBMITTED]
    I --> J{Verification}
    J -->|Verify| K[VERIFIED]
    J -->|Reject| L[REJECTED]
    K --> M[Update Realized / Execution Status]
